      <description>&lt;p&gt;Bellow 1.0.0-rc.9 is the first release that updates itself. The app checks once a day and offers each update before installing it; &lt;b&gt;Check for Updates…&lt;/b&gt; in the menu bar asks right away.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Also in this release: downloads and the website moved to a dedicated repository, and the app no longer looks for the data directory of its old name.&lt;/p&gt;
